WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:08.870
Welcome to PDRA, the Pre-Disaster Risk Assessment System of Gingoog City. Here's how to request an account.

00:08.920 --> 00:11.690
On the home page, click Request access.

00:11.740 --> 00:14.830
Type your full name.

00:14.880 --> 00:19.330
Enter your email address. Your username and password will be sent here.

00:19.380 --> 00:24.350
Enter your mobile number. It must have eleven digits, and start with zero nine.

00:24.400 --> 00:28.630
Choose your barangay from the list.

00:28.680 --> 00:33.820
Your position is optional, but it helps the CDRRMO confirm who you are.

00:33.870 --> 00:36.830
Check your details, then click Submit Request.

00:36.880 --> 00:46.220
That's it! The CDRRMO will review your request. Once it's approved, your login details will be emailed to you.
